.TH SDL_CreateHapticEffect 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_CreateHapticEffect \- Create a new haptic effect on a specified device.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_haptic.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_HapticEffectID SDL_CreateHapticEffect(SDL_Haptic *haptic, const SDL_HapticEffect *effect);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I haptic
an
.BR SDL_Haptic
device to create the effect on\[char46]
.TP
.I effect
an
.BR SDL_HapticEffect
structure containing the properties of the effect to create\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the ID of the effect on success or -1 on failure; call
.BR SDL_GetError ()
for more information\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_DestroyHapticEffect (3),
.BR SDL_RunHapticEffect (3),
.BR SDL_UpdateHapticEffect (3)
